  "$audit": {
    "openQuestions": [
      "Figma's frame gives every section BOTH a DM Sans uppercase label AND a Playfair 40px headline (e.g. 'Label Title' above 'Experience'). The build has only one line per section, now styled as the label. section.headline is therefore an orphan token until a second line and its copy are decided.",
      "section.number is solid accent in Figma at all times. The build fades it 45% -> 100% as an active-section cue. Retained deliberately; flag if you want Figma's constant accent instead.",
      "work.link sits top-right of the card in the build; in Figma it sits below the description inside the Project Info column. Left alone because the earlier audit marked the work blocks structurally faithful — say the word to move it."
    ]
